<div class="sect1">
<div class="titlepage"><div><div><h2 class="title" style="clear: both">
<a name="zend.pdf.introduction"></a>55.1. Introduction</h2></div></div></div>
<p>
        The <code class="classname">Zend_Pdf</code> component is a <acronym class="acronym">PDF</acronym> (Portable Document
        Format) manipulation engine. It can load, create, modify and save documents. Thus it can
        help any <acronym class="acronym">PHP</acronym> application dynamically create <acronym class="acronym">PDF</acronym>
        documents by modifying existing documents or generating new ones from scratch.
        <code class="classname">Zend_Pdf</code> offers the following features:

        </p>
<div class="itemizedlist"><ul class="itemizedlist" style="list-style-type: disc; ">
<li class="listitem"><p>
                    Create a new document or load existing one.

                    <a href="#ftn.id43861" class="footnote" name="id43861"><sup class="footnote">[7]</sup></a>
                </p></li>
<li class="listitem"><p>
                    Retrieve a specified revision of the document.
                </p></li>
<li class="listitem"><p>
                    Manipulate pages within a document. Change page order, add new pages, remove
                    pages from a document.
                </p></li>
<li class="listitem"><p>
                    Different drawing primitives (lines, rectangles, polygons, circles, ellipses and
                    sectors).
                </p></li>
<li class="listitem"><p>
                    Text drawing using any of the 14 standard (built-in) fonts or your own custom
                    TrueType fonts.
                </p></li>
<li class="listitem"><p>
                    Rotations.
                </p></li>
<li class="listitem"><p>
                    Image drawing.

                    <a href="#ftn.id43876" class="footnote" name="id43876"><sup class="footnote">[8]</sup></a>
                </p></li>
<li class="listitem"><p>
                    Incremental <acronym class="acronym">PDF</acronym> file update.
                </p></li>
</ul></div>
<p>
    </p>
</div>
<div class="footnotes">
<br><hr style="width:100; text-align:left;margin-left: 0">
<div id="ftn.id43861" class="footnote"><p><a href="#id43861" class="para"><sup class="para">[7] </sup></a>
